{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Seven cows</b> — after the fair heifer of Egypt. And why seven? After Egypt: Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim, Naphtuchim, Pathrusim, Casluchim — they are seven. And seven nations from the land of Canaan shall be sustained from Egypt."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:05.896851325Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}